        "node_id": "n_1_d65d61",
        "thought_text": "Consider the problem as a pathfinding challenge where the torpedo needs to navigate around obstacles (ships) in a grid. Use A* search algorithm to find a path from (0,0) to (x,y=n) avoiding all ships. The heuristic could be the Manhattan distance from the current position to the target line y=n.",
