        "node_id": "n_2_27bb0b",
        "thought_text": "Simulate the torpedo's movement step by step, checking at each second if it can move to any of the three possible positions without hitting a ship. Keep track of visited positions to avoid cycles. If the torpedo reaches y=n without hitting any ship, output the sequence of moves; otherwise, output 'impossible'.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794408191.2008362
      },
      "rev_n_3_3a67cb_0": {
