        "node_id": "n_3_3a67cb",
        "thought_text": "Use dynamic programming to determine if it's possible to reach y=n without hitting any ship. Define a DP table where dp[i][j] is true if there's a way to reach (i,j) without hitting any ship. Initialize dp[0][0] as true and fill the table based on possible moves from previous positions. If dp[*][n] is true for any x, output a valid path; otherwise, output 'impossible'.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
